nations><Explanation_h>Index CREDITSMGR.PK_CM_PORTFOLIO is created on table CREDITSMGR.CM_PORTFOLIO(ID)</Explanation_h><Explanation_h>Index CREDITSMGR.IDX_FULL_PORTFOLIO is created on table CREDITSMGR.CM_PORTFOLIO(ID, CURRENCY, BOOROWERID, INITIALAMOUNT, CREDITLINEAMOUNT, ANNUALYINTERESTRATE, ANNUALYOVERDUERATE, ANNUALYPENALTYRATE, DATEOFCONCLUSION, DATEOFGRANT, DUEDATEFIRSTCONTRACT, DUEDATELASTCONTRACT, CLOSEDATE, NUMBEROFCREDIT, PURPOSEOFCREDIT, CUSTOMERTYPE, CREDITTYPE, PERSONALTYPE, AUTOPAYMENT, AUTOEXPIRE, USRGROUP, BRANCHID, USID, PARTITIONKEY)</Explanation_h></Explanations><Children/><DbObjects/><Exclusions/><Scripts><ExecuteScripts><Execute>DROP INDEX CREDITSMGR.PK_CM_PORTFOLIO</Execute><Comment>/* DROP reductant index */</Comment></ExecuteScripts><UndoScripts><Execute>CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "CREDITSMGR"."PK_CM_PORTFOLIO"
